      "reason": "The suggestion permits confirming watchdog coverage. The only actual run call is main, which starts the 60-second AfterFunc before calling run. main cannot execute its deferred watchdog.Stop until run and all run defers, including a.Close and workerDone join, have returned. The callback runs in a separate Go goroutine. The admitted native controller independently enforces a 75-second owned-process watchdog. A blocked join remains covered by fatal failure protection for this CLI/controller path.",
